\id GEN Longhand test fixture, invented text
\h Genesis
\toc1 The Fixture of Genesis
\mt1 Genesis
\c 1
\p
\v 1 In the first chapter the fixture opens with a plain sentence.
\v 2 A second sentence follows so the chapter has more than one verse.
\v 3 The third sentence closes the first chapter.
\c 2
\p
\v 1 The second chapter begins again from one.
\v 2 It has only two verses, which keeps the fixture small.
